+/* The ACTIONABLE chip (subject-enrolment round B): struck through like a blocked one, because a record
+   is missing — but the name is a real button, so the strike is a to-do rather than a refusal. The state
+   words beside it mean the strike is never the only signal (colour and line are not accessible signals),
+   and the button re-states them as its accessible name. The strike lives on the BUTTON, not on the chip:
